    "Chapter-specific named characters (Imperial Fists, Iron Hands, Salamanders, Raven Guard, Ultramarines, White Scars) were pulled in from https://mfm.warhammer-community.com/en/space-marines, since they do not appear on the Blood Angels page.",
    "Units priced with Requisition Threshold tiers (e.g. \"Your 1st to 2nd Units Cost\" vs \"Your 3rd+ Unit Costs\") are represented as separate options per tier, matching the pattern already used for Sanguinary Guard.",
    "Eradicator Squad is now two distinct datasheet variants on this MFM (With Heavy Bolters / With Melta Rifles) rather than a single base entry with a heavy-bolter option.",
    "Kaius Konorius is officially listed under Ultramarines on the generic Space Marines MFM page at 100 pts, matching the prior user-supplied interim value.",
    "Detachments merged the same way as units: the 16 detachments shared between the Blood Angels and generic Space Marines pages were verified identical (DP cost and enhancement points) before merging; Angelic Inheritors, Encarmine Speartip and Wrath of the Doomed are Blood Angels-only, the remaining 6 (Blade of Ultramar, Ceramite Sentinels, Forgefather's Seekers, Medusa's Wrath, Shadowmark Talon, Spearpoint Task Force) are pulled in from the generic Space Marines page."
